{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25750","headline":"长安少年行 四 · 李廓","name":"长安少年行 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好胜耽长夜，天明烛满楼。\n留人看独脚，赌马换偏头。\n乐奏曾无歇，盃巡不暂休。\n时时遥冷笑，怪客有春愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}